#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-from-dom0.rst:44
#: 90ca1c930e324e11a5bbfd45bee30b75
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can put your text in a file, then :ref:`copy it as a file "
"<user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-from-dom0:copying files from dom0>`. Or, you "
"can write the data you wish to copy into ``/var/run/qubes/qubes-"
"clipboard.bin``, then ``echo -n dom0 > /var/run/qubes/qubes-"
"clipboard.bin.source``. Then use Ctrl+Shift+V to paste the data to the "
"target qube."
msgstr ""

